    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror in which you're trapped inside your own school, hunted by a relentless entity. As you navigate through the ever-changing hallways, you must find a way to escape, all while avoiding the creature lurking in the shadows. In Klasztorna, the environment shifts, distorting reality and testing your perception. The line between what's real and what's imagined blurs, and only your wits can help you survive. Can you escape, or will the darkness consume you?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror in which you're trapped inside your own school, hunted by a relentless entity. As you navigate through the ever-changing hallways, you must find a way to escape, all while avoiding the creature lurking in the shadows. In Klasztorna, the environment shifts, distorting reality and testing your perception. The line between what's real and what's imagined blurs, and only your wits can help you survive. Can you escape, or will the darkness consume you?</p>",
    "short_description": "A psychological horror where you're trapped inside your own school, hunted by an unrelenting entity. As you search for an escape, the walls shift around you, and reality begins to distort. Escaping is just as important as keeping your sanity intact.",
